A||N||11||1FST2M6||I drop a full 2tenths off my 1/8!!||||1||
Z||000000||1FST2M6||03-26-2001||09:26 AM||||I was talking to a friend and he has a spare 4.5" cone filter I bought it from him for $20.. (oh RodrV6.. you can have my stock K&N) well it would drop right on the stock intake tube.. but the temps would be just stoopid high.. and the sucking noise was unbareable in the car. you couldn't hear yourself think! anywho.. so i went to the shop.. and found a 90* 2.5" bend and an 11" piece of 2.5" tubing (the piping we use for turbo hard piping) measured and cut welded and drilled a BIG hole. after asembly i closed the hatch and POOF.. no annoying sucking sound and a larger volue in the intake.. well the dyno computers were sut off for the day but we were running the 1/8 anyway.. <P>all last weekend i ran consistant 10.0++s... well this sunday i ran 2 9.8++s at 67-69mph a 1 9.9++!!! Pics and time slip to follow in a few minutes. <P>My buddy in his Focus deceided to gut his car.. we took the seats carpet and a spare out he went from 11.3s to 10.5!!!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> <P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/1fst9.jpg"> <BR>i'm #321 the guy next to me is a friend in a 97 Maxima... <P>in the tech inspection lanes... <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/1fsttech.JPG"> <P><p>[This message has been edited by 1FST2M6 (edited 03-26-2001).]||||reg||1
